// Waivers for our RTL in the unit tests, the same as in
// 3.build/run-lint-waivers.txt.
//
// A unique case lists only the legal values of its selector (CRC term
// counts 0 .. 4, the three line rates); any other value is a unique
// violation by design, and our rules forbid a default in a unique case.
`verilator_config
lint_off -rule CASEINCOMPLETE -file "*1.hw/iclink_serwb_pkg.sv"
lint_off -rule CASEINCOMPLETE -file "*1.hw/iclink_phy_pkg.sv"
